# Required skill: canvas (content windows optimization)

For this repository (`tax-app-krns`), agents **must** follow the project skill at [`.cursor/skills/canvas/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/canvas/SKILL.md).

## Mandate

When producing standalone analytical or multi-section deliverables (feature matrices, admin/security/architecture reviews, metrics tables, workflow summaries), **do not** dump large tables or long structured reports only in chat. Create or update a **Cursor Canvas** content window per the `canvas` skill so the user can open a focused side panel.

## Before finishing such a response

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/canvas/SKILL.md`
2. Write a `.canvas.tsx` under the managed canvases directory
3. Publish (cloud) or link the canvas file (local)
4. Keep the chat reply short and point to the canvas

Ordinary code changes, commits, and short answers do not require a canvas.
